You are placing a dot to represent $6.5$ on this number line. Where should you place it?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(6.5,0);
\foreach \x in {0,...,6} {\draw (\x,0.12)--(\x,-0.12);}
\node[below] at (0,-0.12) {$6.1$};
\node[below] at (6,-0.12) {$6.7$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

